{"about_the_game":"<strong>BACK THE KICKSTARTER NOW!</strong><br><br>Art is a young college graduate looking for his first serious job. After a series of unsuccessful interviews, the Grim Reaper itself materializes in front of Art's eyes and, impressed by the young man's skills, offers him a job as an intern at his own company, Death Corp.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/extras/e5b17a2d98c851e96b8afe0e5194b476.poster.avif?t=1768651595\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/extras/e5b17a2d98c851e96b8afe0e5194b476.webm?t=1768651595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/extras/e5b17a2d98c851e96b8afe0e5194b476.mp4?t=1768651595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Meet tons of ridiculous characters, harvest the souls of those who recently passed away and, sometimes, push forward fate by solving outrageous and hilarious puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/extras/ad8582897f6e912c8072627a5f029d6d.poster.avif?t=1768651595\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/extras/ad8582897f6e912c8072627a5f029d6d.webm?t=1768651595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/extras/ad8582897f6e912c8072627a5f029d6d.mp4?t=1768651595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dark humor with bright colors scenes divided in independent chapters with constant references to film and book genres, pop culture and classic point and click games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/extras/cef342b148295342458474ff3f3eeab0.poster.avif?t=1768651595\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/extras/cef342b148295342458474ff3f3eeab0.webm?t=1768651595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/extras/cef342b148295342458474ff3f3eeab0.mp4?t=1768651595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic 2D point-and-click adventure (just the way you like it!)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A wicked story full of fantasy and humor</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hand-drawn backgrounds, characters, and interface!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mixed of frame by frame and squeleton animations</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play the Demo now!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2146280?t=1768651595","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2146280?t=1768651595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768651595","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768651595","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\u201cThis game contains light mature content such as cartoon violence\"."},"demos":[{"appid":2164940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<strong>BACK THE KICKSTARTER NOW!</strong><br><br>Art is a young college graduate looking for his first serious job. After a series of unsuccessful interviews, the Grim Reaper itself materializes in front of Art's eyes and, impressed by the young man's s